        "confianza": "alta"
      },
      {
        "texto": "Cerrar la válvula de corte antes del filtro.",
        "t": 77.32,
        "cita": "Next I close the shove off valve before the filter, it turns it to the right all the way.",
        "fuente": "audio",
        "confianza": "alta"
      },
      {
        "texto": "No usar barra de extensión si la válvula no cierra correctamente.",
        "t": 91.88,
        "cita": "If the valve doesn't close or it's too sniffed, don't use an extension bar called the sniff supervisor.",
        "fuente": "audio",
        "confianza": "alta"
      },
      {
        "texto": "Liberar la presión con precaución, es el mayor riesgo.",
        "t": 102.12,
        "cita": "Now I release the pressure, this is the highest risk, water under pressure when the housing is opened.",
